    "mouse": "PASS",
    "keyboard": "PASS",
    "fixture": "Windows XP Pro SP3 at 1920x1200; Internet Explorer 8 MAXIMISED on the retronet corpus page http://home.microsoft.com/ (\"Microsoft Internet Start\"), no proxy configured. An Internet Explorer shortcut sits on the desktop behind it. ICQ 2001b (build 3659) is docked top-right, signed in as UIN 51000 with its server-stored (SSI) contact list rendered by name. The frame is steady apart from ICQ's own contact-list group header, which cycles between \"Online\" and \"Last Online\" in a ~58x7 px region - so two shots seconds apart are NOT always byte-identical."
  },
